1. REVERSE ENGINEERING RESTRICTION:
   Notwithstanding the general permissions granted above, under no circumstances
   may any individual, automated agent, script, bot, or organization use,
   deploy, or execute automated Reverse Engineering harnesses, deconstruction
   agents, automated decompilation frameworks, or REA ("Reverse Engineer Anything")
