   deployed instances without the explicit prior written authorization of the
   Copyright Holder.

2. BAN ON AUTOMATED RECONSTRUCTION HARNESSES:
   The systematic scanning, scraping, pattern cloning, or automated extraction
   of application architecture, algorithms, prompting frameworks, or internal
   mechanics using autonomous inspection frameworks or REA tools is strictly
   prohibited.

